WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.552
Real auctions are richer.

00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:03.250
In e-commerce advertising,

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:07.232
many bidders compete for many ad slots described by
features,

00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:10.823
and every round has a different number of participants.

00:00:10.903 --> 00:00:15.980
We need an architecture that absorbs context and
handles varying auction sizes.
